        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Removed overly restrictive flag validation that was incorrectly rejecting valid filter configurations.",
        "what": "Removed brace blocks and validation checks from two conditional statements in ctnetlink_parse_filter(). Specifically removed the checks that validated orig_flags and reply_flags against CTA_FILTER_F_ALL mask, which previously returned -EOPNOTSUPP for invalid flag bits.",
        "how": "This change allows any flag value to be assigned to filter->orig_flags and filter->reply_flags without validation. Previously, setting any bit outside the CTA_FILTER_F_ALL mask would cause the function to reject the request with -EOPNOTSUPP. Now invalid flag patterns will be silently accepted."
      }
